# STIG AS24-U1-000870: Cookies exchanged between the Apache web server and the clie
# STIG ID: V-214268 (MEDIUM)

META
    esp_id `apache-as24-u1-000870-session-cookie-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `apache`
    criticality `high`

    title `STIG AS24-U1-000870: Cookies exchanged between the Apache web server and the client, such as session `
    description `Cookies exchanged between the Apache web server and the client, such as session cookies, must have cookie properties set to prohibit client-side scripts from reading the cookie data.`
    author `example-security`
    tags `apache,stig,disa-stig,combined`

    control_mapping `DISA-STIG:AS24-U1-000870,NIST-800-53:SC-8`
    control_objective `SC-8`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `system-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `Apache:localhost:web-hardening`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `30`
    recommendation `Review and remediate per DISA Apache STIG guidance for AS24-U1-000870.`

    component_id `comp-apache-web`

    impl_SC_8 `This control is validated by checking the Apache HTTP server configuration against the DISA STIG baseline.`

META_END

DEF
    VAR config_path string `/etc/httpd/conf/httpd.conf`

    OBJECT module_check
        module `session_cookie_module`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE module_loaded
        loaded boolean = true
    STATE_END

    OBJECT httpd_config
        path VAR config_path
    OBJECT_END

    STATE directive_present
        content string contains `SessionCookieName`
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN apache_module
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF module_loaded
            OBJECT_REF module_check
        CTN_END

        CTN file_content
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF directive_present
            OBJECT_REF httpd_config
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
